a:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"1. Who we are"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Talk to Me Data is a trading name of ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"MATUTTO LTD"}],", a company registered in England and Wales (company number ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"12558540"}],"), registered office ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"106 Cranston Court, 56 Bloemfontein Road, London W12 2FG"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["In this policy, “we”, “us” and “our” mean ","MATUTTO LTD",". “You” means anyone who visits our website or uses the Service."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Contact for anything privacy-related:"}]," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:nas@talktomedata.com","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"nas@talktomedata.com"}]]}]]}]
b:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"2. Our role: controller and processor"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"We are the controller"}]," for your account details, billing information, how you use the Service, and the public data we collect to run our agents (see section 7)."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"We act as a processor for our business customers"}]," for the content our agents handle on their behalf, such as the emails, documents and contact lists a customer connects or uploads. The customer decides what our agents do with that data. If your personal data reached us through one of our customers, for example because you emailed them, please contact that customer first. We will help them respond to you."]}]]}]]}]
c:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"3. What we collect"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-6","children":"3.1 Information you give us"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Account details:"}]," your name, email address and password (stored securely by our authentication provider; we never see it in plain text). If you sign in with Google, we receive your name, email address and profile picture from Google."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Onboarding answers:"}]," company name, company size, location, industry, your role, how you heard about us, and whether the account is for a business or personal brand."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Agent requests and chats:"}]," the instructions you give your agents, the questions you ask them and the answers they produce."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brand kit and designs:"}]," logos, colours, fonts, captions and images you upload or create in the Create studio."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Contact lists (Property Leads agent):"}]," contact lists you upload from your CRM so we can match them against property records."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Messages to us:"}]," anything you send us by email, through the contact page or the forms on our website (such as the demo request and get-started forms, which ask for your email, name, role, team size and what you’d like to automate), or during a call you book with us."]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-6","children":"3.2 Information from the tools you connect"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"When you connect a tool such as Gmail, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Google Sheets, Outlook, Slack, Notion, HubSpot or others, you grant our agents permission to read and act on data in that tool. We use a connection provider, Composio, to hold the access tokens securely. Our agents only access the data needed to do the job you asked for, when you ask for it or when an agent you scheduled runs."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The content our agents read (for example an email thread or a spreadsheet) is processed to complete the task and is stored only as part of that agent’s conversation history, so you can see what it did."}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-6","children":"3.3 Information from social media platforms"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Public profile data."}]," When you add a social media account to the Social Media Manager (your own or a competitor’s), we collect publicly available information about that account and its recent posts: handle, display name, bio, profile picture, follower and following counts, and each post’s caption, thumbnail, publish date and public engagement figures (views, likes, comments, shares). We collect this through the YouTube Data API and through Apify, a data collection provider, for Instagram, TikTok and Facebook Pages."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Accounts you connect for posting (Instagram, Facebook, TikTok)."}]," If you choose to connect an account so our agent can post for you, you sign in on that platform’s own page and approve the permissions listed below. We never see your password."]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]
d:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"4. How we use your data and our lawful bases"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"UK data protection law requires a lawful basis for each use of personal data. Ours are:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full text-sm text-left","children":[["$","thead",null,{"className":"bg-muted/40","children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","What we do",{"className":"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-foreground align-top","children":"What we do"}],["$","th","Lawful basis",{"className":"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-foreground align-top","children":"Lawful basis"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Create and run your account, run your agents, connect your tools, publish your posts, send the reminders and digests you set up"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Contract"}],": we need to do this to provide the Service you signed up for"]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Take payments, manage your subscription, send receipts"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Contract"}]}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Keep financial and tax records"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Legal obligation"}]}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Collect public social media data and public property records to power the Social Media Manager and Property Leads agents"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Legitimate interests"}],": providing market and competitor insight from information people have chosen to make public (see section 7)"]}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Keep the Service secure, prevent fraud and abuse, fix bugs"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Legitimate interests"}],": protecting our users and our Service"]}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Understand how people use the Service so we can improve it (analytics using cookies), and measure our advertising"}],["$","td","1",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-foreground","children":"Consent"}],": via our cookie banner, which you can change at any time"]}]]}],["$","tr","6",{"className":"border-t border-border","children":[["$","td","0",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground align-top leading-relaxed","children":"Count visits and clicks anonymously without cookies, when you choose “Necessary only”"}],"$L29"]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}]]}]}]}],"$L2d","$L2e"]}]
e:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"5. Google and YouTube data"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Google user data."}]," Talk to Me Data’s use and transfer of information received from Google APIs to any other app will adhere to the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"Google API Services User Data Policy"}],", including the Limited Use requirements. In particular:"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"we only use Google user data (for example Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Docs or Sheets data) to provide the features you asked for;"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"we do not use it for advertising;"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"we do not sell it or transfer it to others, except to provide the Service, to comply with the law, or as part of a merger or acquisition with notice to you;"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"no person at Talk to Me Data reads it unless you ask us to (for example for support), it is needed for security or to comply with the law, or it has been aggregated and anonymised; and"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"we do not use it to train general-purpose AI or machine-learning models."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"YouTube."}]," The Social Media Manager uses YouTube API Services to show public data about YouTube channels. By using those features you agree to be bound by the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.youtube.com/t/terms","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"YouTube Terms of Service"}],", and Google’s use of data is covered by the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://policies.google.com/privacy","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"Google Privacy Policy"}],". We only access public channel and video data using an API key. We do not ask for access to your YouTube account. We delete YouTube data we have stored when you remove that channel from your dashboard, and we keep and refresh it in line with the YouTube API Services Developer Policies. You can also revoke any access through Google’s security settings page at"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://myaccount.google.com/permissions","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"myaccount.google.com/permissions"}],"."]}]]}]
f:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"6. How we use AI"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Our agents are powered by large language models from ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Anthropic"}]," (Claude) and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Google"}]," (Gemini, including for generating images). When an agent works on a task, we send the relevant content (your instructions, and data from your connected tools or social accounts) to these providers so they can produce a response."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["We use their paid, commercial API services. Under those terms, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"they do not use our data to train their models"}],", and they keep it only for a limited period for safety and abuse monitoring."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":"We do not use your data to train AI models of our own."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"AI can make mistakes. Please check important outputs before relying on them."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Automated decision-making."}]," The Service analyses public post performance and generates suggestions, but we do not make any decisions based solely on automated processing that have a legal or similarly significant effect on you."]}]]}]
10:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4","children":"7. Data about people who are not our users"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Some of our agents use information about people who have not signed up to Talk to Me Data. We handle it carefully:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Public social media accounts."}]," If a customer adds your public Instagram, TikTok, YouTube or Facebook Page account to their dashboard (for example as a competitor), we collect the public profile and post data described in section 3.3. We only collect what you have made public, we keep a limited number of recent posts, and we use it to show performance insights to that customer. We do not collect private messages, private accounts or follower lists."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Public property records."}]," The Property Leads agent uses public records published by US local government bodies (such as county assessor data, building permits, property sales, vacancy and code-violation records, and foreclosure auctions). These records can include property owners’ names."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Contacts uploaded by customers."}]," Property Leads customers may upload their own contact lists. The customer is the controller of that data and we process it on their behalf."]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["If you’d like to know whether we hold data about you, object to it being processed, or ask us to delete it, email ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:nas@talktomedata.com","className":"text-foreground underline underline-offset-4","children":"nas@talktomedata.com"}],". We will act on your request unless we have a compelling legal reason not to, in whic